{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine waves also.","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:31:09.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869255533595590726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Roy you said you needed to talk to me last night. I'm sorry I couldn't stay up. After the fight last night I was exhausted. Do you have time to talk now?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:34:16.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869256317691387935","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I know you want to talk to sonny. I'm sorry I didn't bring him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:36:13.657000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869256810597613628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy follows with his eyes Bo leaving the park. \"We need to meet Heore. Preferably getting her out of her lab. I don't know if it wouldn't turn into a fight. That meat thing was not something that should roam the streets again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:36:29.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869256877538676738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"We're looking for people in case it would turn less than pretty.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:37:10.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869257047466709024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Ideally, we'd be able to reason with her, but... we'll be preparing supplies just in case. So if there's anything in particular you need we might be able to help there.'","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:37:58.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869257251884507196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Agreed, she needs to be stopped.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:38:09.955000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869257298386771969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Im sure sonny would be willing to help. But I will ask him the next time I see him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:40:13.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869257816500736101","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I personally haven't had much experience dealing with her or *him*, so I don't trust them. But, some among us have dealt with her before. So I want to check in with others about this. If we could ensure that doesn't happen without spilling blood, that's great.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:40:31.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869257891427778592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"And personally, I want to also make sure she's not being thrown under the carriage by a certain someone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:41:33.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258151172661318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I... unless we come up with a better plan, I will likely be using my old body to bait her out. If anything happens to it in the process, I---' she takes a minute to breathe. 'I'll deal. I'd rather not anyone else's gets desecrated, but if mine does... it's not like I'm using it.'","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:42:11.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258313144090716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sabrine, let's see our opinions first before we do that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:43:41.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258688840495154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Alright. Just noting it as a potential to consider.'","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:43:58.055000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258758423982122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"But that would still be deception that might not make her really eager to discuss things. If you or Sonny might have something better, we're all ears.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:44:09.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258807736418314","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"quietly, '...I mean... if she promises not to make abominations with it, I'd g-give it to her to study if that's what it takes...'","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:44:43.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258949038333992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she's shivering somewhat..","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:44:54.900000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869258996849184808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I dont think she would hold to the promise.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:46:05.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869259292786712596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"We do need to try and get her out of the lab. That would be the first step.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:47:37.438000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869259678582976522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...I don't know either. But I feel like... if anyone I know can talk to her successfully, barring *him* and his associates, it'll be me. With assistance, of course, but... She knows what I used to be. I think she even... sympathised?'","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:47:40.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869259690025041961","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
